{"seq":1,"slug":"mind-and-principle","title":"Mind And Principle","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/wang-yangming/ideas-and-methods/mind-and-principle","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"no-principle-outside-mind","title":"心外无理","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/wang-yangming/ideas-and-methods/mind-and-principle/no-principle-outside-mind","wordCount":2042,"readingTime":9},{"seq":2,"slug":"against-zhu-xi","title":"与朱熹的分歧","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/wang-yangming/ideas-and-methods/mind-and-principle/against-zhu-xi","wordCount":1837,"readingTime":8}],"introHtml":"<p>本章呈现王阳明&quot;心即理&quot;思想的展开。&quot;心外无理&quot;主张天理就在本心之中；&quot;心外无物&quot;则以&quot;岩中花树&quot;的对话，揭示物的意义与呈现离不开人心的照察——二者共同确立了&quot;心&quot;作为道德与意义之根源的根本地位。本章还辨析了王阳明与朱熹在&quot;理&quot;的根源、&quot;格物&quot;的含义、工夫繁简上的根本分歧。这场&quot;朱王之辩&quot;，是中国思想史上的一场伟大论辩。</p>\n"}